1. Start backend + frontend
2. Upload a contract, wait for completed evaluation
3. Expand a clause section (e.g., "Dealbreaker" or "Non-Standard")
4. Hover over a clause card — thumbs up/down appear
5. Click thumbs down — button highlights, comment input appears
6. Type "bad analysis" and press Enter
7. Move cursor away — controls disappear
8. Hover back — thumbs down selected, "bad analysis" shown
